        "product_summary": "Faux leather upper: Textured panels and a curved double-stitched forefoot seam define the casual profile.\nContrast panel design: Light quarter overlays and small navy inserts add a distinct side-view finish.\nLace-up low-cut shape: Crossed laces, metal upper eyelets and a padded collar form the photographed opening.\nMD sole profile: A light sculpted sidewall pairs with forefoot grooves and a dark toe contact section.\nWholesale size assortment: Brown and Olive Grey are offered in EU 39–48 for colour-size order planning.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
